  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 505.09 Program Documentation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 505.09 Program Documentation.\n\n(a) Each PWS that is required by Env-Dw 505.02(a) to have a cross-connection program shall file with the department a copy of its legally-adopted cross-connection control program.\n\n(b) Any subsequent revisions to a cross-connection control program approved in accordance with Env-Dw 505.11 shall be filed with the department as specified in Env-Dw 505.11.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 505) #10615, eff 6-1-14; ss by #14120, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw500.html"
